  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Political Participation phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase public understanding of and engagement in political processes, with a focus on women and young people, to improve the way the political process supports development, poverty reduction and stability in Bangladesh. Strategic fund with the FCO. In line with Business Case, responds flexibly to conflict and political instability risks brought on by to COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
